<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DeKalb, Delta &amp; Pine.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DeKalb, Delta &amp; Pine.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney started coverage of DeKalb Genetics Corp as neutral, Pioneer Hi-Bred International Inc as buy and Delta and Pine Land Co as neutral, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- DeKalb rose 1-1/4 to 41-1/2, Delta and Pine Land fell 1/4 to 34-1/4 and Pioneer was unchanged at 68-1/2.</p>
</text>
